{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on your backpack! Hike, jump, and climb through charming minigames to traverse a rugged landscape and help the old islanders with their deliveries. All while managing a backpack that's always a little too small!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of vanishing traditions in a futuristic world, a missing scientist, and an unfolding mystery in this charming little adventure with big pixels. Serenading a quieter life, the island calls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644970/extras/6cfcd44802cc743962b34299d600d6f6.poster.avif?t=1773689626\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644970/extras/6cfcd44802cc743962b34299d600d6f6.webm?t=1773689626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644970/extras/6cfcd44802cc743962b34299d600d6f6.mp4?t=1773689626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around the island and deliver everything from regular parcels to peculiar oddities. Manage your inventory and be careful not to damage anything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the islanders. They might be reserved in the presence of strangers, but help them enough, and they might open up and help you in return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move by running, jumping, climbing and balancing over rivers and creeks. The heavier your backpack, the harder it gets to tackle these obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Clifford's Island's mysteries, a search for things you might not want to find, and the pull for a quieter life in a fast and loud world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a short adventure of around 4 to 6 hours. Perfect for a relaxing evening or two!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Day 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/0a1681224b9b7aecfe7706bf1db864f8322cce70.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Letters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/0a1681224b9b7aecfe7706bf1db864f8322cce70.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh Batteries","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/0a1681224b9b7aecfe7706bf1db864f8322cce70.jpg"},{"name":"Change Of Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/0a1681224b9b7aecfe7706bf1db864f8322cce70.jpg"},{"name":"Area Knowledge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/bb8c253a3efc82cf4ff5662b1fce6332935de727.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/bb8c253a3efc82cf4ff5662b1fce6332935de727.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/bb8c253a3efc82cf4ff5662b1fce6332935de727.jpg"},{"name":"Meditations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644970/bb8c253a3efc82cf4ff5662b1fce6332935de727.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644970?t=1773689626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644970/6b0883537ba2d4777ce22267d155e2e265f5e671/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773689626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644970/2709e5e18b133321085c640604b1de9466c9f3e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773689626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644970/2709e5e18b133321085c640604b1de